POST http://localhost:3001/api/citas

Content-Type: application/json
{
"disenoId": "spooky-coquette",
"nombreCliente": "Ev",
"telefono": "123",
"fecha": "2026-10-18",
"hora": "08:00",
"largo": "corto",
"extras": []
}
### Cita válida
POST http://localhost:3001/api/citas
Content-Type: application/json

